---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Places I want to visit">
  <h1>Places I want to visit</h1>
  <p class="introduction">Some of the places I'd like to see, and why.</p>
  <figure>
    <img src="/garden.jpg"
         alt="A drawing of a tree in blossom, standing on a green lawn under a blue sky."
         width="1200" height="800">
    <figcaption>The kind of tree I'd like to sit under for an afternoon.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <h2>Places on my list</h2>
  <p>I'm happiest somewhere with old streets, good walks and a café at the end of them.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://visityork.org/">York</a></li>
    <li>Edinburgh</li>
    <li><a href="https://visitbath.co.uk/">Bath</a></li>
    <li>Whitby</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Find out more about <a href="https://visityork.org/">visiting York</a>.</p>
  <h2>Some ideas</h2>
  <ul class="card-grid" role="list">
    <li class="card">
      <h3>A quiet garden</h3>
      <p>Somewhere to sit and do nothing for an afternoon.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>A day in York</h3>
      <p>Walls, museums and far too many tea rooms.
         <a href="https://visityork.org/">Plan a visit</a>.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>About this project</h3>
      <p><a href="/about.html">Read about this website</a>.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">A note: this website is a work in progress.</p>
</SiteLayout>
